/-! ### Case II: $x=c-u\in[\frac12,x_1]$ -/

/-- [DIRX], §3.1, Case II: for $x=c-u\in[\frac12,x_1]$ (and $y=c+u<1$), using the monotonicity
of $\mathrm{J}$, $|\mathrm{J}'|$ on $[\frac12,x_1]$ and $[x_1,1]$,
